    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Story </h2>When you wake up, you find that the evening class has ended, and there is only you left in the entire classroom.<br>After simply complaining that your friend is unreliable, you made plans to go home.<br>But this classroom doesn't seem to want you to leave here so easily.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980940/extras/203b246618bd4a0098f9d23ece5434ee.avif?t=1718011295\" width=620 height=374 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Purchase Notice </h2>You need to find some clues in repeated loop scenes, break free from the loop, and be able to leave the classroom.<br>In the loop, you may experience some terrifying things, but please rest assured that you can definitely break free from the loop of the classroom.<br>This game does not contain any other decryption elements, the only thing you need to do is crack the loop and leave the classroom!<br><br><strong> This is a small horror game that has no save and is in the same enclosed environment.<br>If you are afraid of the dark, please increase the gamma value for the best gaming experience. </strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Special Tips </h2><strong> Facing unknown situations, please carefully distinguish whether it will lead to death.<br><br>Trying to experience more floors may help you find a way to leave.<br><br>Pay attention to the leftover notes and combine them with special numbers to quickly find the exit. </strong>",
